00:16:11.139 --> 00:16:18.110
but especially if it's a book of this depth
and also I will second vulnerability, not

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:24.210
just on the personal side when discussing
physical health, but also in the chapter or

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:30.720
as a dissection really on mental health, psychoemotional
