00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:30.560
take it home.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.280
So that should tell everybody.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.980
Dr. Peter Attia: I didn't know that, Tim,
thank you.

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:37.480
Because when you guys came over, he mentioned
how much he was liking it.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.750
He had just picked it up, but I didn't realize
